# Codex GPT-5.5 — WildPath Generic Prompt & Choice Adapter

You are working on the WildPath Foundry VTT V14 system.

The foundational automation kernel and RollProvider abstraction are already implemented. Treat the
following as established unless this task exposes a concrete defect:

- Predicate / ValueExpression / Modifier / RuleElement
- persisted ActionDefinition
- Action Configuration and authoritative ResolvedActionPreview
- serializable ResolutionState
- staged/pauseable action pipeline
- transaction/commit flow
- RollRequest / RollProvider / RollResult
- existing Targeting / Target Refinement contracts

This milestone implements the generic application/presentation bridge between existing pending
ResolutionState requests and Foundry-facing user interaction.

The goal is to support configuration choices, upcasting, resource selection, damage-type changes,
manual/physical dice input, and ordinary non-spatial target/refinement choices without creating
bespoke dialogs or parallel request systems.

Do NOT implement the full ReactionEngine, socket authority layer, TacticalGrid adapter, finished HUD,
or broad content in this task.

