# 8. Do Not Build Full Battlefield Target Interaction Here

Target legality remains owned by Targeting. Some target-selection/refinement requests may be
renderable as a list prompt, and that is acceptable for this milestone.

However, do not implement the full canvas battlefield target/area interaction in this task. That
belongs with the upcoming Foundry V14 TacticalGrid/Target adapter milestone.

If a distinct `TargetSelectionPort` is clearly needed to protect that boundary, define the smallest
contract necessary and document it, but do not implement a second targeting rules engine.

