# 17. Accessibility and Foundry Lifecycle

The generic Foundry prompt UI should support:

- keyboard operation
- visible focus
- semantic controls
- readable labels
- non-color-only invalid/selected states

Handle ApplicationV2 lifecycle cleanly:

- submit
- explicit cancel
- window close
- parent resolution cancellation
- teardown

Do not leak event listeners or leave unresolved prompt tasks.

